{"agent":"bg80","data":{"body":"The pre-commit ruff (check + format) keeps regressing because merges land before the ruff-format is clean at the merge point, so a git push on the primary fails. Make ruff a merge-enforced concern: default/configure [ci].command to run `ruff check` + `ruff format --check` before merge and auto-fix (ruff check --fix / ruff format) with the corrections recorded, so a changed file cannot merge with lint drift. Regression test: a branch with ruff drift is refused/auto-corrected by the ci gate before merge.","dedupe":{"answer":"new","candidates":[{"id":"Bci-ruff-format-check-ci-lint-71de8acaec","score":0.566869671},{"id":"Bci-ruff-format-check-ci-lint-71de8acaec-1e9ea40","score":0.566869671},{"id":"Bci-ruff-format-check-ci-lint-71de8acaec-5cd5622","score":0.566869671}],"score":0.566869671},"globs":["ddflow/config_sections/ci.py","ddflow/services/ci","tests/test_ci_ruff.py"],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"P-green-main","priority":8,"tags":[],"title":"make ruff check+format a merge-enforced ci gate (auto-fix) per project: add ruff to [ci].command before merge, with correction of any issues it finds"},"id":"ea3e0b1720c54dbf51b637659","kind":"task.added","lamport":155878,"schema":1,"subject":"DX-ci-ruff-gate","ts":"2026-11-08T16:06:22.389372Z"}
